    "created_at": "2026-05-04T22:11:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-04T22:11:27Z",
    "body": "Base should effectively be a block container. I'm unsure how this would apply. For auto-select this might matter for `size=` values. I'm unsure why we'd remove support for it though.\n\nI think I agree with Luke, it feels like things just naturally fall out, so I'm not exactly sure what we'd clarify or force here.",
