    "created_at": "2026-05-04T22:56:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-04T22:56:41Z",
    "body": "I kind of regret making field-sizing stop working for base appearance select elements because I've gotten feedback from multiple people that it looks weird when the button resizes. When the author replaces the button we certainly can't do any sizing since we can't run layout on whatever arbitrary content might exist in the button in the future, but in the case that the author doesn't remove the button then we can run the same intrinsic sizing code to determine the width of the button.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
