    "updated_at": "2026-05-05T09:52:18Z",
    "body": "The problem is the intrinsic sizing code isn't well defined, for some elements its incredibly arbitrary and hacky (i'm not sure about for select off the top of my head tbf).\n\nI can see maybe a case for supporting authors to manually set `field-sizing: fixed` and that giving some well defined approach for base appearance. But the default should definitely be to make it behave like it does right now.",
