    "body": "Can you think of a place where that wouldn't be accurate? It seems to just fallback to the fixed path that gets a size based on the length of the longest option using *some algorithm* to determine a size.\n\nI think my gripe with that is the sizing isn't well defined currently. Unless maybe we can define it?",
